sequenceDiagram
    participant R as NextcloudFeedRepository.refresh
    participant F as PendingChangeFlusher
    participant S as Nextcloud server
    participant Y as NextcloudSyncer
    participant DB as Room

    R->>F: flushCounting (push queued changes first)
    F->>S: batched state changes
    R->>S: create feeds that only exist locally (remoteId null)
    R->>Y: pull
    Y->>S: folders, feeds, items (full on first run, then updatedItems since lastModified)
    Y->>DB: one transaction: reconcile folders, reconcile feeds, upsert items
    Note over Y,DB: a pending change for an article wins over the server's state
    R->>F: flushCounting again
    Note over R,F: pull can queue state for articles adopted from before connecting
    R-->>R: SyncReport
